  "description": "Nicholas, infamous for his terrible attitude, is a regular at the “Secret Club.” As usual, he comes to the club to enjoy a session with his partner, K. But the moment he steps into the room, K suddenly throws Nicholas to the floor and transforms into a terrifying presence. Flustered, Nicholas tries to get up, only for K to treat him like a criminal under suspicion of drug charges. To make matters worse, K locks Nicholas in a holding cell and tosses him, handcuffed, to the massive and intimidating Bap?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/play_fake), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/play_fake), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12914438), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000071929), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250565)",
